// chriz-sod-remix 292-294: Imoen in Shadows of Amn (messages in the game's log)
@1 = ~Imoen could not be prepared for Shadows of Amn when Siege of Dragonspear ended. The equipment she still carried has now been stored with the party's other banked equipment; she keeps only her belt.~
@2 = ~Imoen could not be rebuilt as Shadows of Amn's Imoen, so her tome boosts were not carried over.~
@3 = ~Imoen could not be dual-classed to mage (EEex is not running, or it reported an error). She continues as she was.~
@4 = ~Imoen could not learn every spell from Shadows of Amn's Imoen's spellbook.~
@5 = ~Imoen was gone when Siege of Dragonspear ended (another script had removed her), so nothing of hers could be carried over: Shadows of Amn's own Imoen takes her place.~
@6 = ~Imoen could not leave the party when Siege of Dragonspear ended, so she was handed over like the other companions: Shadows of Amn's own Imoen takes her place.~
